              <h3>Step 4: Design and Permitting</h3>
              <p>A well-thought-out design plan is crucial for integrating the new addition seamlessly. Obtaining the necessary permits ensures compliance with local regulations.</p>

              <h3>Step 5: Construction and Finishing Touches</h3>
              <p>Once construction begins, regular communication with the builders ensures that your vision is executed correctly. Attention to detail in finishes, trim work, and cabinetry brings the project to completion with excellence.</p>
            </div>

